.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
.Dd July 30, 2026
.Dt TRACECMP 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm tracecmp
.Nd coalition-scoped raw DTrace descriptor component
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the global provider for
.Dq org.5bsd.trace
version 1.0.0 from
.Pa /Capabilities/System/TraceCmp.cap .
Each global connection creates a capability-mode worker.
The base provider advertises no raw DTrace feature and denies descriptor-open
requests.
.Sh SECURITY
Raw DTrace authority must remain an administrator-only feature of a future
provider.
An ioctl allowlist cannot constrain D programs, probes, actions, targets, or
buffer allocation.
A provider-owned query and aggregation protocol is required for ordinary
untrusted consumers.
Delegation and denial are audited and expose DTrace probes.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dtrace 1 ,
.Xr libtracecmp 3 ,
.Xr capsicum 4 ,
.Xr serviced 8
